# Three private method successors

These are author proposals under [issue1201 comment6724230173](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1201#issuecomment-6724230173). All three complete records preserve identity, chemistry, roles, labels, rejected labels, source scopes, original histories and evidence. Only `ontology_mapping.mapping_quality` changes from EXACT_MATCH to MANUAL_CURATION, with one new LLM_SUGGESTION and one truthful LLM-assisted history event per record. This does not claim human verification.

SELECTOR.json preserves original edit/create kinds and authentic maintained preimages, six source proposals and eight source cases. origin-proof.json contains complete original proposal objects/selected decisions and exact published Git binding proofs. Diarsenic's actual exact As2O3 OLS query is preserved and explicitly qualified; no absent-query allegation is repeated. Benzene triol is unchanged and outside this selection.

The 19 focused checks pass. Native per-owner diagnostics use the unchanged pinned Claw producer, real KG gzip, cached official labels and authentic A842 catalog plus these three and three already-planned UW corrections. Exact identity predicates, label/alias/comment cells and suppression results remain unchanged; method, confidence and source attribution change natively. No full corrected-campaign generation, prior-stamp replay, application or export approval occurred.

Borax alone retains three known unresolved UW references to CHEBI:131366. coupled-dependencies.json binds the exact three original UW correction proposals; combined bounded partonomy passes. Their scientific approval is not recreated here. The first isolated-overlay assertion failed and is preserved; no failure was waived.

The initial private publication attempt refused because its candidate parent directory was absent, before publishing a candidate. Its raw script/log/render remain. The successor creates the private parent and verifies all reused inputs. Initial native author validation refused the erroneous target-kind vocabulary before saving; the corrected source-target document is genuinely saved by save_review and strictly read back by read_review. Native author independence is self_review and scientific_review=false; neither the author nor these controls supplies independent full-owner approval. C previously authored Sulfur composition. Original source/role/lot/allotrope/stock/quantity/export holds persist.

The private native-author-fixture is a genuine local review-only Git snapshot of captured inputs, not a production baseline. Its exact input map and current source identity are retained. No shared branch, partial B, maintained source, ledger, or canonical product was edited. W09's original anchor-bearing pair remains a separately reported transport failure; its raw scientific conclusions are not silently replaced.
